+# Wire Format
+
+Nothing is recorded. This repository contains no ADR, policy document, or other recorded decision designating a specific wire serialisation format; the codebase supports multiple interchangeable formats (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, Protobuf, and MessagePack) as implementation options, but no current recorded decision selects one of them as the project's standard.
